---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;

const navItems = [
  { href: '#protocol', label: t('实验边界', 'Protocol') },
  { href: '#questions', label: t('七个问题', 'Seven questions') },
  { href: '#g2-ablation', label: t('第二代更新', 'G2 ablation') },
  { href: '#next-steps', label: t('下一步', 'Next steps') },
  { href: '#appendix', label: t('历史记录', 'History') },
] as const;
---

<header class="results-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">OPENEVO × WEBSHOP · RESEARCH FINDINGS</p>
  <h1>{t('OpenEvo × WebShop 研究结果', 'OpenEvo × WebShop research findings')}</h1>
  <p class="lede">{t(
    '如果你已经知道实验室在做 OpenEvo × WebShop，但没有跟进每一轮实验，这一页先回答三件事：我们已经看到了什么、最新一轮评测发生了什么、下一步还缺什么。',
    'If you know the lab is working on OpenEvo × WebShop but have not followed every run, this page starts with three questions: what we have learned, what happened in the latest evaluation, and what still needs to be done.',
  )}</p>

  <div class="abstract-box" aria-label={t('30 秒进度摘要', '30-second progress summary')}>
    <div class="abstract-row">
      <span class="abstract-label established">{t('已经看到', 'What we know')}</span>
      <p>{t(
        '模型用自己产生的成功经验做一次参数更新后，在训练没见过的新任务上出现了可重复的提升。这个结论已经独立复现，但它来自 OpenEvo 的内部新任务评估，还不是 SEED 官方保留任务上的正式成绩。',
        'After one parameter update using the model’s own successful experience, performance improved reproducibly on unseen internal tasks. The result replicated independently, but it is still an OpenEvo internal fresh-task result rather than a formal SEED held-out score.',
      )}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="abstract-row">
      <span class="abstract-label latest">{t('最新评测', 'Latest evaluation')}</span>
      <p>{t(
        '2026-08-25，我们已经在 SEED 官方保留任务范围里完成首轮比较。主评测因为动作标签格式不兼容而把模型输出读错，所以两边的 0 分被判为“测量无效”，不能当作模型能力。',
        'On 2026-08-25, we completed the first comparison on the SEED official held-out task range. The primary evaluation misread the model output because the action wrappers were incompatible, so the zero scores on both arms were classified as measurement-invalid rather than model ability.',
      )}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="abstract-row">
      <span class="abstract-label bottleneck">{t('还差一步', 'What remains')}</span>
      <p>{t(
        '下一步不换任务、不换模型，只修复解析兼容性，在同一批 128 个保留任务上重新比较 BASE 与 OpenEvo SD-LoRA。与此同时，多代连续改进仍没有被证明。',
        'Next, keep the same tasks and models, repair only the parser compatibility, and re-run BASE versus OpenEvo SD-LoRA on the same 128 held-out tasks. Stable multi-generation improvement is still not established.',
      )}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="cutoff-note">
    <strong>{t('机制结论截至 H1.41', 'Mechanism conclusions through H1.41')}</strong>
    <span>{t(
      'H1.42 是之后的测量校准记录；2026-08-25 的 SEED 官方保留任务评测是另一条后续评测记录。它们会单独标注，不与 H1.41 的机制结论混在一起。',
      'H1.42 is a later measurement-calibration record, while the 2026-08-25 SEED held-out run is a separate later benchmark-facing evaluation. Both are labelled separately from the H1.41 mechanism conclusions.',
    )}</span>
  </div>

  <nav class="paper-nav" aria-label={t('研究结果导航', 'Research results navigation')}>
    {navItems.map((item) => <a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>)}
  </nav>
</header>

<style>
  .results-hero{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:36px 24px 12px;color:var(--color-text)}
  .eyebrow{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.75rem;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:.14em}
  .results-hero h1{margin:0;max-width:940px;font-size:clamp(2.35rem,5vw,4.35rem);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.05em}
  .lede{max-width:760px;margin:22px 0 0;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:1.02rem;line-height:1.75}
  .abstract-box{max-width:960px;margin-top:30px;border-block:2px solid var(--color-text)}
  .abstract-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:150px minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px;padding:16px 0}
  .abstract-row+.abstract-row{border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)}
  .abstract-label{font-size:.74rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.04em;line-height:1.7}
  .abstract-label.established{color:var(--color-accent)}
  .abstract-label.latest{color:var(--color-info)}
  .abstract-label.bottleneck{color:var(--color-text-muted)}
  .abstract-row p{margin:0;max-width:72ch;font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.72}
  .cutoff-note{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap;max-width:960px;margin-top:20px;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);font-size:.8rem}
  .cutoff-note strong{color:var(--color-accent)}
  .cutoff-note span{max-width:78ch;color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.6}
  .paper-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.45rem 1.3rem;max-width:960px;margin-top:22px;padding:1rem 0;border-block:1px solid var(--color-border)}
  .paper-nav a{color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:.78rem;font-weight:720;text-decoration:none;text-underline-offset:.2em}
  .paper-nav a:hover,.paper-nav a:focus-visible{color:var(--color-text);text-decoration:underline}
  @media(max-width:720px){
    .results-hero{padding:24px 18px 8px}
    .abstract-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}
  }
</style>
